TERMS_19 = [
    ("security-champion", "Security champion", ["security champions", "security ambassador", "champion de la sécurité", "champion de la securite", "mtetezi wa usalama"], "people", "team member with shield badge", {"fr": "Champion de la sécurité", "sw": "Mtetezi wa usalama", "rw": "Intumwa y'umutekano mu itsinda"},
     "A team member (often a developer or manager) who is not a full-time security expert but promotes secure habits in their team and links it to the security specialists.",
     "Champions help spread security knowledge cheaply: they remind colleagues about reviews, updates and phishing, and escalate real problems. A good way for small organisations to build a security culture.",
     "Un membre de l'équipe (souvent développeur ou responsable) qui n'est pas expert sécurité à plein temps mais promeut les bonnes pratiques dans son équipe et fait le lien avec les spécialistes.",
     "Les champions diffusent la culture de sécurité à moindre coût : ils rappellent revues, mises à jour et hameçonnage, et remontent les vrais problèmes. Bonne façon pour une petite organisation de bâtir une culture de sécurité.",
     "Umunyamuryango w'itsinda (akenshi umutegura porogaramu cyangwa umuyobozi) utari impuguke y'umutekano w'igihe cyose ariko ushishikariza itsinda rye imikorere myiza kandi akaba umuhuza n'impuguke.",
     "Izi ntumwa zikwirakwiza ubumenyi bw'umutekano ku giciro gito: zibutsa bagenzi gusuzuma, kuvugurura na phishing, kandi zikagaragaza ibibazo nyakuri. Ni inzira nziza ku bigo bito yo kubaka umuco w'umutekano.",
     "Mwanachama wa timu (mara nyingi msanidi au meneja) ambaye si mtaalamu wa usalama wa muda wote lakini anakuza tabia salama katika timu yake na kuunganisha na wataalamu.",
     "Watetezi hawa husambaza maarifa ya usalama kwa gharama ndogo: huwakumbusha wenzao mapitio, masasisho na hadaa, na kuripoti matatizo halisi. Ni njia nzuri kwa mashirika madogo kujenga utamaduni wa usalama."),
    ("patch-tuesday", "Patch Tuesday and patch cycles", ["patch tuesday", "patch cycle", "patch cycles", "monthly patches", "out-of-band patch", "cycle de correctifs", "mardi des correctifs", "mzunguko wa viraka"], "defense", "calendar with update icon", {"fr": "Patch Tuesday et cycles de correctifs", "sw": "Patch Tuesday na mizunguko ya viraka", "rw": "Patch Tuesday n'ibihe byo gukosora"},
     "Patch Tuesday is the monthly day (second Tuesday) when Microsoft releases security fixes. Many vendors use regular patch cycles, and publish urgent 'out-of-band' patches when a flaw is already being exploited.",
     "Plan to test and install patches soon after release, starting with internet-facing systems and actively exploited flaws. Turn on automatic updates on personal devices; criminals often attack within days of a fix being published.",
     "Le Patch Tuesday est le jour mensuel (deuxième mardi) où Microsoft publie ses correctifs de sécurité. Beaucoup d'éditeurs ont des cycles réguliers et publient des correctifs urgents « hors cycle » quand une faille est déjà exploitée.",
     "Prévoyez de tester et installer les correctifs peu après leur sortie, en commençant par les systèmes exposés à Internet et les failles activement exploitées. Activez les mises à jour automatiques sur vos appareils ; les criminels attaquent souvent dans les jours qui suivent la publication.",
     "Patch Tuesday ni umunsi wa buri kwezi (ku wa kabiri wa kabiri) Microsoft isohora ibikosorwa by'umutekano. Ibigo byinshi bikoresha ibihe bihoraho kandi bigasohora patches z'ingenzi «hanze y'ibihe» iyo intege nke isanzwe ikoreshwa.",
     "Tegura kugerageza no gushyiraho patches vuba nyuma yo gusohoka, utangira ku bikoresho bigera kuri interineti n'intege nke zikoreshwa. Fungura ivugurura ryikora ku bikoresho byawe; abagizi ba nabi bakunze gutera mu minsi nyuma y'itangazwa.",
     "Patch Tuesday ni siku ya kila mwezi (Jumanne ya pili) ambapo Microsoft hutoa marekebisho ya usalama. Wauzaji wengi hutumia mizunguko ya kawaida na kutoa viraka vya dharura «nje ya mzunguko» pale udhaifu unapotumiwa tayari.",
     "Panga kujaribu na kusakinisha viraka mapema baada ya kutolewa, ukianzia mifumo inayofikika kwa intaneti na udhaifu unaotumiwa kikamilifu. Washa masasisho ya kiotomatiki kwenye vifaa vyako; wahalifu mara nyingi hushambulia ndani ya siku baada ya kuchapishwa."),
    ("unified-threat-management", "Unified Threat Management (UTM)", ["utm", "unified threat management", "utm appliance", "gestion unifiée des menaces", "gestion unifiee des menaces", "usimamizi wa pamoja wa vitisho"], "network", "network appliance with several shields", {"fr": "Gestion unifiée des menaces (UTM)", "sw": "Usimamizi wa pamoja wa vitisho (UTM)", "rw": "Gucunga ibyago hamwe (UTM)"},
     "An all-in-one security device or service combining a firewall with other protections such as antivirus, intrusion prevention, web filtering and a VPN, managed from one place.",
     "Popular with small and medium organisations because it is simpler than buying separate tools. Keep its firmware and rules updated and review its logs; one box is also a single point of failure.",
     "Un équipement ou service de sécurité tout-en-un combinant pare-feu et autres protections (antivirus, prévention d'intrusion, filtrage web, VPN), géré depuis un seul endroit.",
     "Très utilisé par les petites et moyennes organisations car plus simple que des outils séparés. Gardez son micrologiciel et ses règles à jour et consultez ses journaux ; une seule boîte est aussi un point de défaillance unique.",
     "Igikoresho cyangwa serivisi y'umutekano ihuza firewall n'izindi nzira zo kurinda nka antivirus, gukumira kwinjira, kuyungurura web na VPN, bicungirwa ahantu hamwe.",
     "Bikunzwe n'ibigo bito n'ibiciriritse kuko byoroshye kuruta kugura ibikoresho bitandukanye. Vugurura firmware n'amategeko yacyo kandi usuzume logs zacyo; agasanduku kamwe kanaba ikibazo kimwe gishobora guhagarika byose.",
     "Kifaa au huduma ya usalama ya yote kwa moja inayochanganya firewall na ulinzi mwingine kama antivirus, kuzuia uvamizi, uchujaji wa wavuti na VPN, inayosimamiwa mahali pamoja.",
     "Hupendwa na mashirika madogo na ya kati kwa kuwa ni rahisi kuliko kununua zana tofauti. Sasisha firmware na kanuni zake na ukague kumbukumbu zake; sanduku moja pia ni sehemu moja ya kushindwa."),
    ("secure-web-gateway", "Secure web gateway (SWG)", ["secure web gateway", "swg", "web gateway", "web proxy filter", "passerelle web sécurisée", "passerelle web securisee", "lango salama la wavuti"], "network", "gateway filtering web traffic", {"fr": "Passerelle web sécurisée (SWG)", "sw": "Lango salama la wavuti (SWG)", "rw": "Irembo ry'umutekano rya web (SWG)"},
     "A service that sits between users and the internet, checking web traffic against policy and threat lists to block malicious sites, downloads and risky categories before they reach the device.",
     "Organisations use a SWG to enforce safe browsing, stop malware and data leaks, and log web activity, including for staff working from home. It complements, not replaces, good user habits.",
     "Un service placé entre les utilisateurs et Internet qui contrôle le trafic web selon la politique et des listes de menaces pour bloquer sites malveillants, téléchargements et catégories risquées avant qu'ils n'atteignent l'appareil.",
     "Les organisations l'utilisent pour imposer la navigation sûre, arrêter malwares et fuites de données et journaliser l'activité web, y compris pour le télétravail. Il complète, sans les remplacer, les bonnes habitudes des utilisateurs.",
     "Serivisi iri hagati y'abakoresha na interineti, igenzura web traffic ikurikije politiki n'urutonde rw'ibyago, ikabuza imbuga mbi, ibikururwa n'ibyiciro biteje akaga mbere y'uko bigera ku gikoresho.",
     "Ibigo bikoresha SWG gushyira mu bikorwa kureba imbuga mu buryo butekanye, guhagarika malware n'ibura ry'amakuru no kwandika ibikorwa bya web, harimo abakorera mu rugo. Yunganira, ntisimbura, imico myiza y'abakoresha.",
     "Huduma iliyo kati ya watumiaji na intaneti, inayokagua trafiki ya wavuti dhidi ya sera na orodha za vitisho kuzuia tovuti hasidi, vipakuliwa na kategoria hatari kabla hazijafika kifaa.",
     "Mashirika hutumia SWG kutekeleza kuvinjari salama, kuzuia programu hasidi na uvujaji wa data na kurekodi shughuli za wavuti, pamoja na wafanyakazi wa nyumbani. Inakamilisha, haichukui nafasi ya, tabia nzuri za watumiaji."),
    ("sd-wan-ztna", "SD-WAN and ZTNA", ["sd-wan", "sdwan", "ztna", "zero trust network access", "software defined wan", "accès réseau zero trust", "acces reseau zero trust", "ufikiaji wa mtandao wa zero trust"], "network", "network links between branches", {"fr": "SD-WAN et ZTNA", "sw": "SD-WAN na ZTNA", "rw": "SD-WAN na ZTNA"},
     "SD-WAN is software that manages and secures links between offices and the internet. ZTNA (zero trust network access) gives each user access only to the specific apps they need, after checking identity and device health, instead of the whole network.",
     "ZTNA is a modern alternative to a classic VPN that gives wide access once connected. It limits damage if an account or device is compromised, which matters for remote work and branch offices.",
     "Le SD-WAN est un logiciel qui gère et sécurise les liaisons entre bureaux et Internet. Le ZTNA (accès réseau zero trust) ne donne à chaque utilisateur accès qu'aux applications précises dont il a besoin, après vérification de l'identité et de l'état de l'appareil, et non à tout le réseau.",
     "Le ZTNA est une alternative moderne au VPN classique qui donne un large accès une fois connecté. Il limite les dégâts si un compte ou appareil est compromis, ce qui compte pour le télétravail et les agences.",
     "SD-WAN ni porogaramu icunga kandi ikarinda imiyoboro iri hagati y'ibiro na interineti. ZTNA (zero trust network access) iha buri mukoresha uburenganzira ku mapfundo yihariye akeneye gusa, nyuma yo kugenzura umwirondoro n'ubuzima bw'igikoresho, aho kuba kuri network yose.",
     "ZTNA ni ubundi buryo bugezweho busimbura VPN isanzwe itanga uburenganzira bwinshi umaze guhuzwa. Igabanya ibyangirika iyo konti cyangwa igikoresho cyahungabanyijwe, ibyo bikaba ari ingenzi ku bakorera kure n'amashami.",
     "SD-WAN ni programu inayosimamia na kulinda viungo kati ya ofisi na intaneti. ZTNA (zero trust network access) humpa kila mtumiaji ufikiaji wa programu mahususi anazohitaji tu, baada ya kukagua utambulisho na afya ya kifaa, badala ya mtandao mzima.",
     "ZTNA ni mbadala wa kisasa wa VPN ya kawaida inayotoa ufikiaji mpana baada ya kuunganishwa. Hupunguza madhara akaunti au kifaa kikidukuliwa, jambo muhimu kwa kazi ya mbali na matawi."),
    ("identity-governance", "Identity governance (IGA) and CIEM", ["identity governance", "iga", "ciem", "cloud infrastructure entitlement management", "access review", "access certification", "gouvernance des identités", "gouvernance des identites", "utawala wa utambulisho"], "identity", "access review checklist", {"fr": "Gouvernance des identités (IGA) et CIEM", "sw": "Utawala wa utambulisho (IGA) na CIEM", "rw": "Imiyoborere y'umwirondoro (IGA) na CIEM"},
     "Identity governance manages who has which access over time: giving access when someone joins, changing it when they move, removing it when they leave, and reviewing it regularly. CIEM does the same for permissions in cloud services.",
     "Old or excessive accounts and permissions are a top cause of breaches. Run regular access reviews, remove leavers' accounts immediately and give people only the permissions they need (least privilege).",
     "La gouvernance des identités gère qui a quel accès dans le temps : accorder l'accès à l'arrivée, le modifier lors d'un changement de poste, le retirer au départ, et le revoir régulièrement. Le CIEM fait de même pour les permissions des services cloud.",
     "Comptes et permissions anciens ou excessifs sont une cause majeure de brèches. Faites des revues d'accès régulières, supprimez immédiatement les comptes des partants et donnez à chacun seulement les permissions nécessaires (moindre privilège).",
     "Imiyoborere y'umwirondoro icunga ukwemerewe icyo mu gihe: gutanga uburenganzira umuntu ageze, kubuhindura yimutse, kubukuraho agiye, no kubusuzuma buri gihe. CIEM ibikora ku burenganzira muri serivisi za cloud.",
     "Konti n'uburenganzira bwa kera cyangwa burenze ni imwe mu mpamvu nyamukuru z'ibitero. Kora isuzuma ry'uburenganzira buri gihe, ukure konti z'abagiye ako kanya kandi uhe abantu uburenganzira bukenewe gusa (least privilege).",
     "Utawala wa utambulisho husimamia nani ana ufikiaji gani kwa muda: kutoa ufikiaji mtu anapojiunga, kubadilisha anapohama, kuondoa anapoondoka, na kuukagua mara kwa mara. CIEM hufanya hivyo kwa ruhusa katika huduma za cloud.",
     "Akaunti na ruhusa za zamani au kupita kiasi ni sababu kuu ya uvunjaji. Fanya mapitio ya ufikiaji mara kwa mara, ondoa akaunti za walioondoka mara moja na uwape watu ruhusa wanazohitaji tu (least privilege)."),
    ("golden-image", "Golden image and baseline configuration", ["golden image", "gold image", "baseline configuration", "secure baseline", "standard build", "image de référence", "image de reference", "picha ya dhahabu"], "defense", "template computer image", {"fr": "Image de référence et configuration de base", "sw": "Picha ya msingi na usanidi wa msingi", "rw": "Image ntangarugero n'imiterere shingiro"},
     "A golden image is a pre-approved, hardened copy of an operating system and software used to set up new computers the same safe way. A baseline configuration is the agreed secure settings every device should match.",
     "It saves time and removes human errors: new machines start secure and any drift from the baseline can be detected and fixed. Update the image regularly with patches and review the settings against guides such as the CIS Benchmarks.",
     "Une image de référence est une copie préapprouvée et durcie d'un système et de logiciels utilisée pour installer de nouveaux ordinateurs toujours de la même façon sûre. La configuration de base est l'ensemble des réglages sécurisés convenus que chaque appareil doit respecter.",
     "Cela fait gagner du temps et supprime les erreurs humaines : les nouvelles machines démarrent sécurisées et tout écart par rapport à la base est détectable et corrigeable. Mettez l'image à jour avec les correctifs et comparez les réglages à des guides comme les CIS Benchmarks.",
     "Golden image ni kopi yemejwe mbere kandi yakomejwe y'sisitemu na porogaramu ikoreshwa gushyiraho mudasobwa nshya zose mu buryo bumwe butekanye. Baseline configuration ni igenamiterere ry'umutekano ryumvikanyweho buri gikoresho kigomba kuba gihuje.",
     "Bizigama igihe kandi bikuraho amakosa y'abantu: imashini nshya zitangira zitekanye kandi aho zitandukanira na baseline hamenyekana hagakosorwa. Vugurura image buri gihe ukoresheje patches kandi ugereranye igenamiterere n'ubuyobozi nka CIS Benchmarks.",
     "Golden image ni nakala iliyoidhinishwa awali na kuimarishwa ya mfumo wa uendeshaji na programu inayotumika kusanidi kompyuta mpya kwa njia ile ile salama. Usanidi wa msingi ni mipangilio ya usalama iliyokubaliwa ambayo kila kifaa kinapaswa kufuata.",
     "Huokoa muda na kuondoa makosa ya kibinadamu: mashine mpya huanza salama na mkengeuko wowote kutoka msingi hugunduliwa na kurekebishwa. Sasisha picha mara kwa mara kwa viraka na linganisha mipangilio na miongozo kama CIS Benchmarks."),
    ("immutable-infrastructure", "Immutable infrastructure", ["immutable infrastructure", "immutable servers", "cattle not pets", "infrastructure immuable", "miundombinu isiyobadilika"], "cloud", "servers being replaced not repaired", {"fr": "Infrastructure immuable", "sw": "Miundombinu isiyobadilika", "rw": "Ibikorwa remezo bidahinduka"},
     "An approach where servers are never changed after deployment: to update or fix, you build a new, tested image and replace the old one. Nothing is edited by hand on a running machine.",
     "It reduces configuration drift and hidden changes, makes attacks that rely on persistence easier to notice and lets you roll back quickly. Common with containers and cloud services, together with infrastructure as code.",
     "Une approche où les serveurs ne sont jamais modifiés après déploiement : pour mettre à jour ou réparer, on construit une nouvelle image testée et on remplace l'ancienne. Rien n'est modifié à la main sur une machine en production.",
     "Elle réduit la dérive de configuration et les changements cachés, rend plus visibles les attaques qui reposent sur la persistance et permet un retour arrière rapide. Courante avec les conteneurs et le cloud, avec l'infrastructure en tant que code.",
     "Uburyo aho seriveri zitigera zihindurwa nyuma yo gushyirwaho: kugira ngo uvugurure cyangwa ukosore, wubaka image nshya yagerageje ukasimbura iya kera. Nta kintu gihindurwa n'intoki ku mashini ikora.",
     "Bigabanya itandukana ry'igenamiterere n'impinduka zihishe, bigatuma ibitero bishingira ku kuguma bigaragara byoroshye kandi bikemerera gusubira inyuma vuba. Bikunze gukoreshwa na containers na cloud, hamwe na infrastructure as code.",
     "Mbinu ambapo seva hazibadilishwi baada ya kusambazwa: kusasisha au kurekebisha, unajenga picha mpya iliyojaribiwa na kubadilisha ya zamani. Hakuna kinachohaririwa kwa mkono kwenye mashine inayofanya kazi.",
     "Hupunguza mkengeuko wa usanidi na mabadiliko yaliyofichwa, hufanya mashambulizi yanayotegemea kudumu kuonekana kwa urahisi na kuruhusu kurudi nyuma haraka. Ni kawaida na containers na cloud, pamoja na infrastructure as code."),
    ("change-management", "Change management", ["change management", "change control", "change advisory board", "cab", "gestion des changements", "usimamizi wa mabadiliko"], "governance", "approval workflow", {"fr": "Gestion des changements", "sw": "Usimamizi wa mabadiliko", "rw": "Gucunga impinduka"},
     "A controlled process for proposing, reviewing, approving, testing and recording changes to systems, so changes do not accidentally break security or services.",
     "Unplanned changes are a common cause of outages and security gaps. Good practice: a written request, risk check, peer review, test, a rollback plan and a log of who changed what and when.",
     "Un processus contrôlé pour proposer, examiner, approuver, tester et enregistrer les changements apportés aux systèmes, afin qu'ils ne cassent pas par accident la sécurité ou les services.",
     "Les changements non planifiés causent souvent pannes et failles de sécurité. Bonnes pratiques : demande écrite, évaluation du risque, revue par un pair, test, plan de retour arrière et journal de qui a changé quoi et quand.",
     "Uburyo bugenzurwa bwo gutanga ibitekerezo, gusuzuma, kwemeza, kugerageza no kwandika impinduka kuri sisitemu, kugira ngo impinduka zitabangamira umutekano cyangwa serivisi ku buryo butateganyijwe.",
     "Impinduka zitateguwe akenshi zitera guhagarara n'icyuho cy'umutekano. Imikorere myiza: gusaba mu nyandiko, isuzuma ry'ibyago, gusuzumwa na mugenzi, igerageza, gahunda yo gusubira inyuma n'inyandiko y'uwahinduye icyo n'igihe.",
     "Mchakato unaodhibitiwa wa kupendekeza, kukagua, kuidhinisha, kujaribu na kurekodi mabadiliko ya mifumo, ili mabadiliko yasivunje usalama au huduma kwa bahati mbaya.",
     "Mabadiliko yasiyopangwa mara nyingi husababisha kukatika na mapengo ya usalama. Mazoea mazuri: ombi la maandishi, ukaguzi wa hatari, mapitio ya mwenzako, majaribio, mpango wa kurudi nyuma na kumbukumbu ya nani alibadilisha nini lini."),
    ("configuration-management", "Configuration management", ["configuration management", "configuration drift", "ansible puppet chef", "gestion de configuration", "usimamizi wa usanidi"], "defense", "settings synchronised across servers", {"fr": "Gestion de configuration", "sw": "Usimamizi wa usanidi", "rw": "Gucunga igenamiterere"},
     "Keeping the settings of all systems documented, consistent and controlled, often with automation tools, and detecting 'drift' when a system's settings change away from the approved version.",
     "Many breaches come from misconfiguration such as open ports, default passwords or public storage. Automated configuration checks catch these early and make fixes repeatable across all machines.",
     "Maintenir les réglages de tous les systèmes documentés, cohérents et maîtrisés, souvent avec des outils d'automatisation, et détecter la « dérive » quand les réglages s'éloignent de la version approuvée.",
     "De nombreuses brèches viennent de mauvaises configurations : ports ouverts, mots de passe par défaut, stockage public. Des contrôles de configuration automatisés les repèrent tôt et rendent les corrections reproductibles sur toutes les machines.",
     "Kugumana igenamiterere rya sisitemu zose ryanditse, rihuye kandi rigenzurwa, akenshi hakoreshejwe ibikoresho byikora, no kubona «drift» iyo igenamiterere rya sisitemu ryimukiye kure ya verisiyo yemejwe.",
     "Ibitero byinshi bituruka ku igenamiterere ribi nka ports zifunguye, amagambo y'ibanga asanzwe cyangwa ububiko rusange. Igenzura ryikora ribibona kare kandi rigatuma ibikosorwa bisubirwamo ku mashini zose.",
     "Kuweka mipangilio ya mifumo yote ikiwa imeandikwa, thabiti na kudhibitiwa, mara nyingi kwa zana za kiotomatiki, na kugundua «drift» mipangilio ya mfumo inapohama toleo lililoidhinishwa.",
     "Uvunjaji mwingi hutokana na usanidi mbaya kama ports wazi, nywila chaguo-msingi au hifadhi ya umma. Ukaguzi wa usanidi wa kiotomatiki huvigundua mapema na kufanya marekebisho yarudiwe kwenye mashine zote."),
    ("asset-inventory-cmdb", "Asset inventory and CMDB", ["asset inventory", "cmdb", "configuration management database", "it asset management", "inventaire des actifs", "inventaire des biens", "orodha ya mali za tehama"], "operations", "list of devices and software", {"fr": "Inventaire des actifs et CMDB", "sw": "Orodha ya mali na CMDB", "rw": "Urutonde rw'ibikoresho na CMDB"},
     "A maintained list of all devices, software, accounts, data and cloud services an organisation owns or uses (a CMDB links them and shows relationships). You cannot protect what you do not know you have.",
     "Unknown or forgotten systems (shadow IT, old servers) are favourite targets. Start simple: record each device, owner, location, software version and sensitivity, and review it regularly, including for personal and small-business setups.",
     "Une liste tenue à jour de tous les appareils, logiciels, comptes, données et services cloud qu'une organisation possède ou utilise (une CMDB les relie et montre les relations). On ne peut pas protéger ce qu'on ne sait pas posséder.",
     "Les systèmes inconnus ou oubliés (informatique fantôme, vieux serveurs) sont des cibles favorites. Commencez simple : notez chaque appareil, son responsable, lieu, version logicielle et sensibilité, et révisez régulièrement, y compris pour un usage personnel ou une petite entreprise.",
     "Urutonde ruhoraho rw'ibikoresho byose, porogaramu, konti, amakuru na serivisi za cloud ikigo gifite cyangwa gikoresha (CMDB ibihuza ikerekana isano). Ntushobora kurinda icyo utazi ko ufite.",
     "Sisitemu zitazwi cyangwa zibagiranye (shadow IT, seriveri za kera) ni intego zikunzwe. Tangira byoroshye: andika buri gikoresho, nyiracyo, aho kiri, verisiyo ya porogaramu n'ubuhambare bw'amakuru, usubiremo buri gihe, harimo no mu rugo cyangwa mu bucuruzi buto.",
     "Orodha inayotunzwa ya vifaa vyote, programu, akaunti, data na huduma za cloud ambazo shirika linamiliki au kutumia (CMDB huviunganisha na kuonyesha mahusiano). Huwezi kulinda usichojua unacho.",
     "Mifumo isiyojulikana au iliyosahaulika (shadow IT, seva za zamani) ni walengwa wapendwa. Anza rahisi: rekodi kila kifaa, mmiliki, mahali, toleo la programu na unyeti, na kagua mara kwa mara, pamoja na matumizi binafsi au biashara ndogo."),
    ("attack-surface-management", "Attack surface management (ASM)", ["attack surface management", "asm", "external attack surface management", "easm", "gestion de la surface d'attaque", "usimamizi wa uso wa mashambulizi"], "operations", "map of exposed systems", {"fr": "Gestion de la surface d'attaque (ASM)", "sw": "Usimamizi wa uso wa mashambulizi (ASM)", "rw": "Gucunga aho ibitero bishobora kunyura (ASM)"},
     "Continuously finding, listing and reducing everything of yours that an attacker can reach from outside: websites, servers, open ports, cloud storage, forgotten test systems and leaked credentials.",
     "Defenders scan their own internet-facing assets the way attackers would, close what is not needed, patch what is exposed and monitor changes. Fewer exposed doors means fewer ways in.",
     "Rechercher, lister et réduire en continu tout ce qui vous appartient et qu'un attaquant peut atteindre de l'extérieur : sites web, serveurs, ports ouverts, stockage cloud, systèmes de test oubliés et identifiants divulgués.",
     "Les défenseurs analysent leurs propres actifs exposés à Internet comme le feraient les attaquants, ferment le superflu, corrigent ce qui est exposé et surveillent les changements. Moins de portes exposées, moins de façons d'entrer.",
     "Gushakisha, kurondora no kugabanya ibyawe byose umushimusi ashobora kugeraho avuye hanze: imbuga, seriveri, ports zifunguye, ububiko bwa cloud, sisitemu z'ibizamini zibagiranye n'amagambo y'ibanga yamenetse.",
     "Abarinzi basuzuma ibikoresho byabo bigera kuri interineti nk'uko abashimusi bakora, bagafunga ibitari ngombwa, bagakosora ibigaragara kandi bagakurikirana impinduka. Inzugi nke zigaragara, inzira nke zo kwinjira.",
     "Kutafuta, kuorodhesha na kupunguza kila kitu chako ambacho mshambulizi anaweza kufikia kutoka nje: tovuti, seva, ports wazi, hifadhi ya cloud, mifumo ya majaribio iliyosahaulika na vitambulisho vilivyovuja.",
     "Watetezi huchanganua mali zao zinazofikika kwa intaneti kama washambuliaji wangefanya, hufunga visivyohitajika, husasisha vilivyo wazi na kufuatilia mabadiliko. Milango michache wazi, njia chache za kuingia."),
    ("soc-analyst", "SOC analyst", ["soc analyst", "security operations analyst", "tier 1 analyst", "tier 2 analyst", "security analyst", "analyste soc", "mchambuzi wa soc"], "people", "analyst in front of monitoring screens", {"fr": "Analyste SOC", "sw": "Mchambuzi wa SOC", "rw": "Umusesenguzi wa SOC"},
     "A security professional who monitors alerts and logs in a security operations centre, decides which alerts are real threats, investigates them and escalates or contains incidents.",
     "Analysts often work in tiers: tier 1 triages alerts, tier 2 investigates deeper and tier 3 hunts threats and improves detection. Skills: networking, operating systems, logs, SIEM tools and calm decision-making.",
     "Un professionnel de la sécurité qui surveille alertes et journaux dans un centre d'opérations de sécurité, décide lesquelles sont de vraies menaces, les enquête et escalade ou contient les incidents.",
     "Les analystes travaillent souvent par niveaux : le niveau 1 trie les alertes, le niveau 2 enquête plus en profondeur et le niveau 3 traque les menaces et améliore la détection. Compétences : réseaux, systèmes, journaux, outils SIEM et sang-froid.",
     "Umunyamwuga w'umutekano ukurikirana imburira na logs mu kigo gishinzwe imikorere y'umutekano, agahitamo izirimo ibyago nyakuri, akazisuzuma agatanga cyangwa agahagarika ibitero.",
     "Abasesenguzi bakunze gukora mu byiciro: icya 1 gitondeka imburira, icya 2 gisuzuma byimbitse, icya 3 gishakisha ibyago kikanoza gutahura. Ubumenyi: network, sisitemu, logs, ibikoresho bya SIEM no gutuza mu gufata ibyemezo.",
     "Mtaalamu wa usalama anayefuatilia tahadhari na kumbukumbu katika kituo cha operesheni za usalama, anaamua zipi ni vitisho halisi, kuzichunguza na kupandisha au kudhibiti matukio.",
     "Wachambuzi mara nyingi hufanya kazi kwa ngazi: ngazi ya 1 hupanga tahadhari, ya 2 huchunguza kwa undani na ya 3 huwinda vitisho na kuboresha ugunduzi. Ujuzi: mitandao, mifumo, kumbukumbu, zana za SIEM na utulivu."),
    ("penetration-tester-role", "Penetration tester", ["penetration tester", "pentester", "pen tester", "ethical hacker role", "testeur d'intrusion", "pentesteur", "mjaribu wa uvamizi"], "people", "tester with laptop and checklist", {"fr": "Testeur d'intrusion", "sw": "Mjaribu wa uvamizi", "rw": "Umugerageza kwinjira (pentester)"},
     "A security professional who is hired and authorised in writing to test systems the way an attacker would, then reports the weaknesses found and how to fix them, so they can be repaired before real attackers use them.",
     "A penetration test always has a written scope, rules and permission. Testing systems without permission is illegal. Reports rank findings by risk and suggest fixes; a retest confirms that they were solved.",
     "Un professionnel de la sécurité engagé et autorisé par écrit à tester des systèmes comme le ferait un attaquant, puis à rapporter les faiblesses trouvées et comment les corriger, avant que de vrais attaquants ne les exploitent.",
     "Un test d'intrusion a toujours un périmètre, des règles et une autorisation écrits. Tester des systèmes sans permission est illégal. Les rapports classent les constats par risque et proposent des corrections ; un nouveau test confirme qu'elles ont fonctionné.",
     "Umunyamwuga w'umutekano wahawe akazi kandi wemerewe mu nyandiko kugerageza sisitemu nk'uko umushimusi yabigenza, hanyuma agatanga raporo y'intege nke yabonye n'uko zikosorwa, zigakosorwa mbere y'uko abashimusi nyakuri bazikoresha.",
     "Penetration test ihora ifite urugero, amategeko n'uruhushya byanditse. Kugerageza sisitemu nta ruhushya binyuranyije n'amategeko. Raporo ishyira ibyabonetse mu byiciro by'ibyago kandi igatanga ibikosorwa; igerageza rya kabiri ryemeza ko byakemutse.",
     "Mtaalamu wa usalama aliyeajiriwa na kuruhusiwa kwa maandishi kujaribu mifumo kama mshambulizi angefanya, kisha kuripoti udhaifu uliopatikana na jinsi ya kurekebisha, ili urekebishwe kabla washambuliaji halisi hawajautumia.",
     "Jaribio la uvamizi daima lina wigo, kanuni na ruhusa vilivyoandikwa. Kujaribu mifumo bila ruhusa ni kinyume cha sheria. Ripoti hupanga matokeo kwa hatari na kupendekeza marekebisho; jaribio la pili huthibitisha yamesuluhishwa."),
    ("malware-analyst-role", "Malware analyst", ["malware analyst", "reverse engineer role", "malware researcher", "analyste de malware", "mchambuzi wa programu hasidi"], "people", "analyst examining code in a lab", {"fr": "Analyste de malware", "sw": "Mchambuzi wa programu hasidi", "rw": "Umusesenguzi wa malware"},
     "A specialist who studies malicious software in a safe, isolated lab to learn what it does, how it spreads and how to detect and remove it, and writes detection rules and reports for defenders.",
     "Findings become antivirus signatures, indicators of compromise and advice for victims. Analysts work in sandboxes or virtual machines cut off from real networks; ordinary users should never open suspicious files to 'see what happens'.",
     "Un spécialiste qui étudie les logiciels malveillants dans un laboratoire isolé et sûr pour comprendre leur fonctionnement, leur propagation et comment les détecter et les supprimer, et rédige des règles de détection et des rapports pour les défenseurs.",
     "Les résultats deviennent signatures antivirus, indicateurs de compromission et conseils aux victimes. Les analystes travaillent en bac à sable ou machines virtuelles coupées des vrais réseaux ; un utilisateur ordinaire ne doit jamais ouvrir un fichier suspect « pour voir ».",
     "Impuguke yiga porogaramu mbi mu cyumba cy'igerageza gitandukanye kandi gitekanye kugira ngo imenye icyo zikora, uko zikwirakwira n'uko zitahurwa zigakurwaho, ikandika amategeko yo gutahura na raporo ku barinzi.",
     "Ibyabonetse bihinduka signatures za antivirus, indicators of compromise n'inama ku bahohotewe. Abasesenguzi bakorera muri sandbox cyangwa virtual machines zitandukanye na network nyakuri; umukoresha usanzwe ntagomba gufungura dosiye ikekwa ngo «arebe ibiba».",
     "Mtaalamu anayechunguza programu hasidi katika maabara salama yaliyotengwa kujifunza inachofanya, jinsi inavyosambaa na jinsi ya kuigundua na kuiondoa, na kuandika kanuni za ugunduzi na ripoti kwa watetezi.",
     "Matokeo huwa saini za antivirus, viashiria vya uvamizi na ushauri kwa waathirika. Wachambuzi hufanya kazi kwenye sandbox au mashine pepe zilizotengwa na mitandao halisi; mtumiaji wa kawaida kamwe asifungue faili ya kutiliwa shaka «kuona kitakachotokea»."),
    ("forensic-analyst-role", "Digital forensic analyst", ["forensic analyst", "digital forensics analyst", "forensic investigator", "dfir", "analyste forensique", "mchunguzi wa forensiki"], "people", "investigator examining a disk image", {"fr": "Analyste en forensique numérique", "sw": "Mchunguzi wa forensiki ya kidijitali", "rw": "Umusesenguzi w'ibimenyetso bya digitale"},
     "A specialist who collects and examines digital evidence from computers, phones and networks, in a way that keeps it reliable, to find out what happened and support investigations or legal cases.",
     "They copy disks instead of working on originals, record every step (chain of custody) and use verified tools. If you suspect a crime, stop using the device, do not delete anything and contact your security team or the authorities.",
     "Un spécialiste qui recueille et examine des preuves numériques sur ordinateurs, téléphones et réseaux, de façon à les garder fiables, pour établir ce qui s'est passé et soutenir enquêtes ou procédures judiciaires.",
     "Il copie les disques plutôt que de travailler sur les originaux, consigne chaque étape (chaîne de traçabilité) et utilise des outils vérifiés. Si vous soupçonnez un crime, cessez d'utiliser l'appareil, ne supprimez rien et contactez votre équipe sécurité ou les autorités.",
     "Impuguke ikusanya kandi igasuzuma ibimenyetso bya digitale biva kuri mudasobwa, telefone na network, mu buryo bukomeza kwizerwa, kugira ngo imenye ibyabaye no gushyigikira iperereza cyangwa imanza.",
     "Akoporora disiki aho gukorera ku zumwimerere, yandika buri ntambwe (chain of custody) kandi agakoresha ibikoresho byemejwe. Niba ukeka icyaha, reka gukoresha igikoresho, ntusibe ikintu kandi uvugane n'itsinda ry'umutekano cyangwa ubuyobozi.",
     "Mtaalamu anayekusanya na kuchunguza ushahidi wa kidijitali kutoka kompyuta, simu na mitandao, kwa njia inayoufanya uaminike, kujua kilichotokea na kusaidia uchunguzi au kesi za kisheria.",
     "Hunakili diski badala ya kufanya kazi kwenye asili, hurekodi kila hatua (chain of custody) na kutumia zana zilizothibitishwa. Ukishuku uhalifu, acha kutumia kifaa, usifute chochote na uwasiliane na timu yako ya usalama au mamlaka."),
    ("spam-filter", "Spam filter", ["spam filter", "spam filtering", "anti-spam", "email filtering", "junk mail filter", "filtre anti-spam", "filtre antispam", "kichujio cha spam"], "defense", "inbox with junk folder", {"fr": "Filtre anti-spam", "sw": "Kichujio cha spam", "rw": "Ikiyungurura spam"},
     "Software that sorts unwanted or dangerous email, messages or calls into a junk folder using sender reputation, content rules, authentication checks (SPF, DKIM, DMARC) and machine learning.",
     "Filters catch most bulk phishing but not everything. Keep yours turned on, report missed scams and false alarms so it learns, and still treat unexpected links and attachments with care even when they reach your inbox.",
     "Logiciel qui trie les e-mails, messages ou appels indésirables ou dangereux dans un dossier de courrier indésirable selon la réputation de l'expéditeur, des règles de contenu, des contrôles d'authentification (SPF, DKIM, DMARC) et l'apprentissage automatique.",
     "Les filtres arrêtent la plupart de l'hameçonnage de masse mais pas tout. Gardez le vôtre activé, signalez les arnaques ratées et les fausses alertes pour qu'il apprenne, et restez prudent avec liens et pièces jointes inattendus même dans votre boîte de réception.",
     "Porogaramu ishyira imeri, ubutumwa cyangwa guhamagara bidakenewe cyangwa biteje akaga mu bubiko bw'ibitagira akamaro ikurikije izina ry'uwohereje, amategeko y'ibiri mu butumwa, igenzura ryo kwemeza (SPF, DKIM, DMARC) na machine learning.",
     "Ibyo bisuzuma bifata phishing nyinshi ariko si zose. Gumana ikiyungurura cyawe gifunguye, tanga raporo y'uburiganya bwabuze n'imburira z'ibinyoma kugira ngo cyige, kandi ugumye witonda ku mahuza n'attachments utiteze nubwo zigeze muri inbox.",
     "Programu inayopanga barua pepe, ujumbe au simu zisizotakiwa au hatari kwenye folda ya taka kwa kutumia sifa ya mtumaji, kanuni za maudhui, ukaguzi wa uthibitishaji (SPF, DKIM, DMARC) na ujifunzaji wa mashine.",
     "Vichujio hunasa hadaa nyingi za wingi lakini si zote. Viweke vimewashwa, ripoti ulaghai uliopita na makosa ili vijifunze, na bado shughulikia viungo na viambatisho visivyotarajiwa kwa tahadhari hata vikifika kwenye kikasha chako."),
    ("mta-sts-bimi", "MTA-STS and BIMI", ["mta-sts", "mta sts", "bimi", "brand indicators for message identification", "tls-rpt", "email transport security", "sécurité du transport des e-mails", "usalama wa usafirishaji wa barua pepe"], "network", "email with brand logo and lock", {"fr": "MTA-STS et BIMI", "sw": "MTA-STS na BIMI", "rw": "MTA-STS na BIMI"},
     "MTA-STS makes mail servers use encrypted TLS when delivering email to a domain, blocking downgrade tricks. BIMI shows a verified brand logo next to messages that pass strong email authentication (DMARC).",
     "They help organisations protect mail in transit and make genuine mail easier to recognise. A logo is not proof of safety by itself, so keep checking sender addresses and links in unexpected messages.",
     "MTA-STS impose aux serveurs de messagerie d'utiliser un chiffrement TLS pour livrer le courrier vers un domaine, bloquant les attaques par rétrogradation. BIMI affiche un logo de marque vérifié à côté des messages qui passent une authentification forte (DMARC).",
     "Ils aident les organisations à protéger le courrier en transit et à rendre le courrier légitime plus reconnaissable. Un logo n'est pas à lui seul une preuve de sûreté : continuez à vérifier adresses d'expéditeur et liens des messages inattendus.",
     "MTA-STS ituma seriveri z'imeri zikoresha TLS ifunze mu kugeza imeri kuri domain, ibuza amayeri yo kugabanya umutekano. BIMI yerekana ikirango cy'ikigo cyemejwe iruhande rw'ubutumwa bwatsinze kwemeza gukomeye kw'imeri (DMARC).",
     "Bifasha ibigo kurinda imeri iri mu nzira no koroshya kumenya imeri nyayo. Ikirango si icyemezo cy'umutekano ubwacyo, bityo komeza ugenzure aderesi z'abohereje n'amahuza mu butumwa utiteze.",
     "MTA-STS hufanya seva za barua pepe kutumia TLS iliyosimbwa wakati wa kupeleka barua kwa kikoa, kuzuia hila za kushusha usalama. BIMI huonyesha nembo ya chapa iliyothibitishwa karibu na ujumbe unaopita uthibitishaji imara (DMARC).",
     "Husaidia mashirika kulinda barua njiani na kurahisisha kutambua barua halisi. Nembo si uthibitisho wa usalama peke yake, hivyo endelea kukagua anwani za watumaji na viungo katika ujumbe usiotarajiwa."),
    ("vpn-kill-switch-split-tunnel", "VPN kill switch and split tunnelling", ["vpn kill switch", "kill switch", "split tunneling", "split tunnelling", "full tunnel", "interrupteur vpn", "tunnel fractionné", "tunnel fractionne", "swichi ya kuzima vpn"], "network", "VPN tunnel with a switch", {"fr": "Kill switch VPN et tunnel fractionné", "sw": "Kill switch ya VPN na split tunnelling", "rw": "Kill switch ya VPN na split tunnelling"},
     "A VPN kill switch cuts your internet if the VPN drops, so traffic never leaks unprotected. Split tunnelling sends only some traffic through the VPN while the rest goes directly to the internet.",
     "Turn the kill switch on when privacy matters, for example on public Wi-Fi. Split tunnelling is convenient but leaves some traffic outside the protection; organisations may prefer a full tunnel for company data.",
     "Un kill switch VPN coupe votre connexion Internet si le VPN tombe, afin que le trafic ne fuie jamais sans protection. Le tunnel fractionné n'envoie qu'une partie du trafic par le VPN, le reste allant directement sur Internet.",
     "Activez le kill switch quand la confidentialité compte, par exemple sur un Wi-Fi public. Le tunnel fractionné est pratique mais laisse une partie du trafic hors protection ; les organisations préfèrent souvent un tunnel complet pour les données de l'entreprise.",
     "Kill switch ya VPN ihagarika interineti yawe iyo VPN ihagaze, kugira ngo amakuru atagenda nta burinzi. Split tunnelling yohereza gusa igice cya traffic muri VPN naho ibindi bikajya kuri interineti mu buryo butaziguye.",
     "Fungura kill switch igihe ibanga rifite akamaro, urugero kuri Wi-Fi rusange. Split tunnelling ni nziza ariko igasiga igice cya traffic hanze y'uburinzi; ibigo bikunze guhitamo full tunnel ku makuru y'ikigo.",
     "Kill switch ya VPN hukata intaneti yako VPN ikikatika, ili trafiki isivuje bila ulinzi. Split tunnelling hutuma trafiki fulani tu kupitia VPN huku nyingine ikienda moja kwa moja kwenye intaneti.",
     "Washa kill switch faragha inapohitajika, mfano kwenye Wi-Fi ya umma. Split tunnelling ni rahisi lakini huacha trafiki nje ya ulinzi; mashirika mara nyingi hupendelea full tunnel kwa data ya kampuni."),
    ("i2p-darknets", "I2P and other darknets", ["i2p", "freenet", "darknet", "darknets", "onion routing", "onion services", "surface web", "reseaux darknet", "mitandao ya darknet"], "network", "layers of hidden networks", {"fr": "I2P et autres darknets", "sw": "I2P na darknet nyingine", "rw": "I2P n'izindi darknets"},
     "Darknets are overlay networks reached only with special software, such as Tor (onion routing), I2P or Freenet, that hide who connects to what. The 'surface web' is the normal, indexed internet; the 'deep web' is just content behind logins.",
     "They protect privacy for journalists, activists and ordinary people, but are also used by criminals. Being on one is not illegal in itself; avoid illegal marketplaces and downloads, and note that malware and scams are common there.",
     "Les darknets sont des réseaux superposés accessibles seulement avec des logiciels spéciaux comme Tor (routage en oignon), I2P ou Freenet, qui cachent qui se connecte à quoi. Le « web de surface » est l'internet normal indexé ; le « web profond » n'est que du contenu derrière un identifiant.",
     "Ils protègent la vie privée de journalistes, militants et simples citoyens, mais sont aussi utilisés par des criminels. Y être n'est pas illégal en soi ; évitez les marchés et téléchargements illégaux, et sachez que malwares et arnaques y sont fréquents.",
     "Darknets ni imiyoboro yihishe igerwaho gusa na porogaramu zihariye nka Tor (onion routing), I2P cyangwa Freenet, ihisha ukwihuza n'icyo ahuye na cyo. «Surface web» ni interineti isanzwe ishakwa; «deep web» ni ibirimo inyuma y'aho winjirira gusa.",
     "Zirinda ibanga ry'abanyamakuru, abaharanira uburenganzira n'abantu basanzwe, ariko zikoreshwa n'abagizi ba nabi. Kuzibamo si icyaha ubwabyo; irinde amasoko n'ibikururwa binyuranyije n'amategeko, kandi umenye ko malware n'uburiganya bikunze kuhaboneka.",
     "Darknet ni mitandao ya juu inayofikiwa tu kwa programu maalum kama Tor (onion routing), I2P au Freenet, inayoficha nani anaunganishwa na nini. «Surface web» ni intaneti ya kawaida iliyoorodheshwa; «deep web» ni maudhui nyuma ya kuingia tu.",
     "Hulinda faragha ya waandishi wa habari, wanaharakati na watu wa kawaida, lakini pia hutumiwa na wahalifu. Kuwemo si kosa kwa yenyewe; epuka masoko na vipakuliwa haramu, na ujue programu hasidi na ulaghai ni vya kawaida huko."),
    ("sinkhole-blackhole", "DNS sinkhole and blackhole routing", ["sinkhole", "dns sinkhole", "blackhole routing", "black hole routing", "rtbh", "sinkholing", "trou noir", "routage trou noir", "uelekezaji wa shimo jeusi"], "network", "traffic falling into a funnel", {"fr": "Sinkhole DNS et routage trou noir", "sw": "DNS sinkhole na uelekezaji wa shimo jeusi", "rw": "DNS sinkhole na blackhole routing"},
     "A DNS sinkhole answers requests for known malicious domains with a harmless address so infected devices cannot reach their controllers. Blackhole routing throws away attack traffic aimed at a target to protect the rest of the network.",
     "Defenders and agencies use sinkholes to cut botnets and to count infected computers. Blackholing sacrifices the targeted address temporarily during a large DDoS to keep other services running.",
     "Un sinkhole DNS répond aux requêtes vers des domaines malveillants connus par une adresse inoffensive, pour que les appareils infectés ne joignent plus leurs contrôleurs. Le routage trou noir jette le trafic d'attaque visant une cible pour protéger le reste du réseau.",
     "Défenseurs et agences utilisent les sinkholes pour couper des botnets et compter les ordinateurs infectés. Le trou noir sacrifie temporairement l'adresse visée pendant un gros DDoS afin de maintenir les autres services.",
     "DNS sinkhole isubiza ibyifuzo by'amazina ya domain mbi izwi aderesi itagira ingaruka, kugira ngo ibikoresho byanduye bitagera ku bibigenzura. Blackhole routing ijugunya traffic y'igitero igamije intego kugira ngo irinde indi network.",
     "Abarinzi n'ibigo bikoresha sinkholes gukata botnets no kubara mudasobwa zanduye. Blackholing itamba aderesi yibasiwe by'agateganyo mu gihe cya DDoS nini kugira ngo izindi serivisi zikomeze gukora.",
     "DNS sinkhole hujibu maombi ya vikoa hasidi vinavyojulikana kwa anwani isiyo na madhara ili vifaa vilivyoambukizwa visifikie wadhibiti wao. Blackhole routing hutupa trafiki ya shambulio inayolenga lengo kulinda mtandao uliosalia.",
     "Watetezi na mashirika hutumia sinkholes kukata botnets na kuhesabu kompyuta zilizoambukizwa. Blackholing hutoa anwani inayolengwa kwa muda wakati wa DDoS kubwa ili huduma nyingine ziendelee."),
    ("geo-blocking", "Geo-blocking and IP reputation filtering", ["geo-blocking", "geo blocking", "geoblocking", "ip reputation", "ip blocklist", "country blocking", "blocage géographique", "blocage geographique", "kuzuia kwa eneo"], "network", "world map with blocked regions", {"fr": "Blocage géographique et réputation IP", "sw": "Kuzuia kwa eneo na sifa ya IP", "rw": "Kubuza ukurikije igihugu n'izina ry'IP"},
     "Blocking or limiting traffic from certain countries or from IP addresses with a bad reputation (known for spam, scanning or attacks) to reduce unwanted traffic and common attacks.",
     "It cuts a lot of noise cheaply but is not foolproof: attackers use VPNs or hacked machines in allowed countries, and legitimate users can be blocked. Use it as one layer, with MFA, rate limiting and monitoring.",
     "Bloquer ou limiter le trafic venant de certains pays ou d'adresses IP à mauvaise réputation (connues pour le spam, le scan ou les attaques) afin de réduire le trafic indésirable et les attaques courantes.",
     "Cela supprime beaucoup de bruit à faible coût mais n'est pas infaillible : les attaquants utilisent des VPN ou des machines piratées dans des pays autorisés, et des utilisateurs légitimes peuvent être bloqués. Utilisez-le comme une couche parmi d'autres, avec MFA, limitation de débit et surveillance.",
     "Kubuza cyangwa kugabanya traffic iva mu bihugu runaka cyangwa kuri aderesi za IP zifite izina ribi (zizwiho spam, gusuzuma cyangwa ibitero) kugira ngo hagabanuke traffic idakenewe n'ibitero bisanzwe.",
     "Bigabanya urusaku rwinshi ku giciro gito ariko si ukuri kwose: abashimusi bakoresha VPN cyangwa imashini zahungabanyijwe mu bihugu byemewe, kandi abakoresha nyakuri bashobora kubuzwa. Gikoreshwe nk'urwego rumwe, hamwe na MFA, imbibi z'umuvuduko no gukurikirana.",
     "Kuzuia au kupunguza trafiki kutoka nchi fulani au anwani za IP zenye sifa mbaya (zinazojulikana kwa spam, uchanganuzi au mashambulizi) ili kupunguza trafiki isiyotakiwa na mashambulizi ya kawaida.",
     "Hupunguza kelele nyingi kwa gharama ndogo lakini si kamilifu: washambuliaji hutumia VPN au mashine zilizodukuliwa katika nchi zinazoruhusiwa, na watumiaji halali wanaweza kuzuiwa. Itumie kama tabaka moja, pamoja na MFA, kikomo cha kasi na ufuatiliaji."),
    ("allowlist-blocklist", "Allowlist and blocklist", ["allowlist", "blocklist", "denylist", "whitelist", "blacklist", "allow list", "block list", "liste blanche", "liste noire", "liste d'autorisation", "orodha ya kuruhusu", "orodha ya kuzuia"], "defense", "two lists: allowed and blocked", {"fr": "Liste d'autorisation et liste de blocage", "sw": "Orodha ya kuruhusu na orodha ya kuzuia", "rw": "Urutonde rwemerera n'urutonde rubuza"},
     "An allowlist (whitelist) names the only things that are permitted, such as approved apps or senders. A blocklist (denylist) names things that are forbidden, such as known bad websites. Everything else is handled by the default rule.",
     "Allowlists are stronger but need maintenance; blocklists are easier but miss new threats. Many organisations use allowlisting for critical systems. Terms 'allowlist' and 'blocklist' are now preferred over 'whitelist' and 'blacklist'.",
     "Une liste d'autorisation (liste blanche) nomme les seules choses permises, comme des applis ou expéditeurs approuvés. Une liste de blocage (liste noire) nomme ce qui est interdit, comme des sites malveillants connus. Tout le reste suit la règle par défaut.",
     "Les listes d'autorisation sont plus solides mais demandent de l'entretien ; les listes de blocage sont plus simples mais manquent les nouvelles menaces. Beaucoup d'organisations utilisent l'autorisation explicite pour les systèmes critiques.",
     "Urutonde rwemerera (whitelist) rutanga gusa ibyemerewe, nka porogaramu cyangwa abohereza bemejwe. Urutonde rubuza (blocklist) rutanga ibibujijwe, nk'imbuga mbi zizwi. Ibindi byose bikurikiza itegeko risanzwe.",
     "Urutonde rwemerera rukomeye kurushaho ariko rukeneye kubungabungwa; urubuza ruroroshye ariko ntirubona ibyago bishya. Ibigo byinshi bikoresha allowlisting kuri sisitemu z'ingenzi. Amagambo allowlist na blocklist ubu akunzwe kurusha whitelist na blacklist.",
     "Orodha ya kuruhusu (whitelist) hutaja vitu pekee vinavyoruhusiwa, kama programu au watumaji walioidhinishwa. Orodha ya kuzuia (blocklist) hutaja vinavyokatazwa, kama tovuti mbaya zinazojulikana. Mengine yote hufuata kanuni chaguo-msingi.",
     "Orodha ya kuruhusu ni imara zaidi lakini inahitaji matengenezo; ya kuzuia ni rahisi lakini hukosa vitisho vipya. Mashirika mengi hutumia allowlisting kwa mifumo muhimu. Maneno allowlist na blocklist sasa hupendelewa kuliko whitelist na blacklist."),
    ("captive-portal", "Captive portal", ["captive portal", "wifi login page", "hotel wifi login", "portail captif", "ukurasa wa kuingia wa wi-fi"], "network", "hotel Wi-Fi login page", {"fr": "Portail captif", "sw": "Captive portal", "rw": "Captive portal"},
     "The web page that appears when you join a public Wi-Fi (hotel, café, airport) asking you to accept terms or log in before using the internet.",
     "Fake captive portals are used by 'evil twin' hotspots to steal passwords or card numbers. Never enter banking or email passwords on one, check the network name with staff and use mobile data or a trusted VPN for sensitive tasks.",
     "La page web qui s'affiche quand vous rejoignez un Wi-Fi public (hôtel, café, aéroport) et vous demande d'accepter des conditions ou de vous connecter avant d'utiliser Internet.",
     "De faux portails captifs servent aux points d'accès « evil twin » pour voler mots de passe ou numéros de carte. N'y saisissez jamais de mots de passe bancaires ou de messagerie, vérifiez le nom du réseau auprès du personnel et utilisez les données mobiles ou un VPN de confiance pour les tâches sensibles.",
     "Urupapuro rwa web rugaragara iyo wihuza na Wi-Fi rusange (hoteli, café, ikibuga) rugusaba kwemera amabwiriza cyangwa kwinjira mbere yo gukoresha interineti.",
     "Captive portals z'impimbano zikoreshwa na hotspots za «evil twin» kwiba amagambo y'ibanga cyangwa nimero za karita. Ntuzigere wandika amagambo y'ibanga ya banki cyangwa imeri kuri zo, baza abakozi izina ry'umuyoboro kandi ukoreshe data ya telefone cyangwa VPN wizeye ku bikorwa by'ingenzi.",
     "Ukurasa wa wavuti unaoonekana unapojiunga na Wi-Fi ya umma (hoteli, mkahawa, uwanja wa ndege) unaokuomba ukubali masharti au uingie kabla ya kutumia intaneti.",
     "Captive portal bandia hutumiwa na hotspot za «evil twin» kuiba nywila au namba za kadi. Kamwe usiweke nywila za benki au barua pepe kwenye hizo, uliza wafanyakazi jina la mtandao na utumie data ya simu au VPN inayoaminika kwa kazi nyeti."),
    ("mac-filtering-ssid", "MAC filtering and hidden SSID", ["mac filtering", "mac address filtering", "hidden ssid", "ssid", "ssid hiding", "wps", "wi-fi protected setup", "filtrage mac", "ssid caché", "ssid cache", "kichujio cha mac"], "network", "router settings page", {"fr": "Filtrage MAC et SSID caché", "sw": "Kichujio cha MAC na SSID iliyofichwa", "rw": "Kuyungurura MAC na SSID ihishe"},
     "The SSID is the name of a Wi-Fi network. MAC filtering allows only listed device addresses, and a hidden SSID does not broadcast the name. WPS is a quick-connect button or PIN feature of many routers.",
     "MAC filtering and hiding the SSID give little real protection because both can be bypassed. The better steps are WPA3 or WPA2-AES, a long passphrase, turning WPS off (its PIN can be guessed) and updating router firmware.",
     "Le SSID est le nom d'un réseau Wi-Fi. Le filtrage MAC n'autorise que les adresses d'appareils listées, et un SSID caché ne diffuse pas le nom. Le WPS est une fonction de connexion rapide par bouton ou PIN de nombreux routeurs.",
     "Le filtrage MAC et le masquage du SSID protègent très peu car on peut contourner les deux. Mieux vaut WPA3 ou WPA2-AES, une longue phrase secrète, désactiver le WPS (son PIN peut être deviné) et mettre à jour le micrologiciel du routeur.",
     "SSID ni izina ry'umuyoboro wa Wi-Fi. MAC filtering yemera gusa aderesi z'ibikoresho biri ku rutonde, naho SSID ihishe ntitangaza izina. WPS ni uburyo bwo guhuza vuba hakoreshejwe buto cyangwa PIN ku ma router menshi.",
     "MAC filtering no guhisha SSID bitanga uburinzi buke cyane kuko byombi birengwa. Inzira nziza ni WPA3 cyangwa WPA2-AES, interuro y'ibanga ndende, kuzimya WPS (PIN yayo ishobora gukekwa) no kuvugurura firmware ya router.",
     "SSID ni jina la mtandao wa Wi-Fi. Kuchuja MAC huruhusu anwani za vifaa zilizoorodheshwa tu, na SSID iliyofichwa haitangazi jina. WPS ni kipengele cha kuunganisha haraka kwa kitufe au PIN kwenye router nyingi.",
     "Kuchuja MAC na kuficha SSID hutoa ulinzi mdogo kwa sababu vyote vinaweza kupitwa. Hatua bora ni WPA3 au WPA2-AES, nenosiri refu, kuzima WPS (PIN yake inaweza kubahatishwa) na kusasisha firmware ya router."),
    ("rogue-dhcp-snooping", "Rogue DHCP and DHCP snooping", ["rogue dhcp", "dhcp snooping", "rogue dhcp server", "dhcp spoofing", "surveillance dhcp", "dhcp pirate", "ukaguzi wa dhcp"], "network", "network switch and a fake DHCP server", {"fr": "DHCP pirate et DHCP snooping", "sw": "DHCP bandia na DHCP snooping", "rw": "DHCP y'impimbano na DHCP snooping"},
     "A rogue DHCP server is an unauthorised device that hands out network settings (address, gateway, DNS) so victims send traffic through the attacker. DHCP snooping is a switch feature that only trusts DHCP replies from approved ports.",
     "Network admins turn on DHCP snooping, together with dynamic ARP inspection and port security, to block these tricks. Users on public networks should rely on HTTPS and a trusted VPN so redirected traffic stays unreadable.",
     "Un serveur DHCP pirate est un appareil non autorisé qui distribue des paramètres réseau (adresse, passerelle, DNS) pour que les victimes envoient leur trafic via l'attaquant. Le DHCP snooping est une fonction du commutateur qui ne fait confiance qu'aux réponses DHCP des ports approuvés.",
     "Les administrateurs activent le DHCP snooping, avec l'inspection ARP dynamique et la sécurité des ports, pour bloquer ces ruses. Les utilisateurs de réseaux publics comptent sur HTTPS et un VPN de confiance pour que le trafic détourné reste illisible.",
     "Seriveri ya DHCP y'impimbano ni igikoresho kidafite uruhushya gitanga igenamiterere rya network (aderesi, gateway, DNS) kugira ngo abahohotewe banyuze traffic ku mushimusi. DHCP snooping ni ikintu cya switch cyizera gusa ibisubizo bya DHCP biva kuri ports zemejwe.",
     "Abayobora network bafungura DHCP snooping, hamwe na dynamic ARP inspection na port security, kugira ngo babuze ayo mayeri. Abakoresha imiyoboro rusange bishingikiriza kuri HTTPS na VPN yizewe kugira ngo traffic ihinduwe itasomeka.",
     "Seva ya DHCP bandia ni kifaa kisichoruhusiwa kinachotoa mipangilio ya mtandao (anwani, lango, DNS) ili waathirika watume trafiki kupitia mshambulizi. DHCP snooping ni kipengele cha swichi kinachoamini majibu ya DHCP kutoka ports zilizoidhinishwa tu.",
     "Wasimamizi wa mtandao huwasha DHCP snooping, pamoja na dynamic ARP inspection na port security, kuzuia hila hizi. Watumiaji wa mitandao ya umma hutegemea HTTPS na VPN inayoaminika ili trafiki iliyoelekezwa ibaki isiyosomeka."),
    ("arp-inspection-port-security", "Dynamic ARP inspection and port security", ["dynamic arp inspection", "dai", "port security", "private vlan", "pvlan", "switch security", "inspection arp dynamique", "sécurité des ports", "securite des ports", "usalama wa port"], "network", "switch with ports and locks", {"fr": "Inspection ARP dynamique et sécurité des ports", "sw": "Dynamic ARP inspection na usalama wa port", "rw": "Dynamic ARP inspection n'umutekano wa port"},
     "Switch protections: dynamic ARP inspection checks ARP messages to stop spoofing, port security limits which and how many devices may use a network port, and private VLANs stop devices in a segment talking directly to each other.",
     "They are standard controls in offices, schools and data centres to contain a compromised or rogue device. Also disable unused ports, use 802.1X authentication and keep switch firmware updated.",
     "Protections de commutateur : l'inspection ARP dynamique vérifie les messages ARP pour bloquer l'usurpation, la sécurité des ports limite quels appareils et combien peuvent utiliser un port, et les VLAN privés empêchent les appareils d'un segment de se parler directement.",
     "Ce sont des contrôles standard dans bureaux, écoles et centres de données pour contenir un appareil compromis ou pirate. Désactivez aussi les ports inutilisés, utilisez l'authentification 802.1X et mettez à jour le micrologiciel des commutateurs.",
     "Uburinzi bwa switch: dynamic ARP inspection igenzura ubutumwa bwa ARP ibuza spoofing, port security igabanya ibikoresho n'umubare byemerewe gukoresha port, naho private VLANs ibuza ibikoresho biri mu gice kimwe kuvugana bitaziguye.",
     "Ni ubugenzuzi busanzwe mu biro, amashuri n'ibigo by'amakuru kugira ngo hagabanywe igikoresho cyahungabanyijwe cyangwa cy'impimbano. Zimya na ports zidakoreshwa, ukoreshe kwemeza kwa 802.1X kandi uvugurure firmware ya switch.",
     "Ulinzi wa swichi: dynamic ARP inspection hukagua ujumbe wa ARP kuzuia spoofing, port security hupunguza ni vifaa gani na vingapi vinaweza kutumia port, na private VLAN huzuia vifaa katika kundi kuzungumza moja kwa moja.",
     "Ni vidhibiti vya kawaida katika ofisi, shule na vituo vya data kudhibiti kifaa kilichodukuliwa au bandia. Zima pia ports zisizotumika, tumia uthibitishaji wa 802.1X na sasisha firmware ya swichi."),
    ("ldap-tacacs", "LDAP and TACACS+", ["ldap", "tacacs", "tacacs+", "radius", "directory service", "ldaps", "annuaire ldap", "huduma ya saraka"], "identity", "directory of users", {"fr": "LDAP et TACACS+", "sw": "LDAP na TACACS+", "rw": "LDAP na TACACS+"},
     "LDAP is a protocol for looking up and managing users and groups in a directory (such as Active Directory). TACACS+ and RADIUS are protocols that centrally check who may log in to network devices and what they may do.",
     "Central logins let organisations add or remove access in one place and log it. Use the secure versions (LDAPS) so passwords are not sent in clear text, and protect directory servers carefully because they hold every account.",
     "LDAP est un protocole pour rechercher et gérer utilisateurs et groupes dans un annuaire (comme Active Directory). TACACS+ et RADIUS sont des protocoles qui vérifient de façon centralisée qui peut se connecter aux équipements réseau et ce qu'il peut y faire.",
     "Les connexions centralisées permettent d'ajouter ou retirer des accès à un seul endroit et de les journaliser. Utilisez les versions sécurisées (LDAPS) pour ne pas envoyer de mots de passe en clair, et protégez soigneusement les serveurs d'annuaire car ils contiennent tous les comptes.",
     "LDAP ni protocol yo gushakisha no gucunga abakoresha n'amatsinda mu rutonde (nka Active Directory). TACACS+ na RADIUS ni protocols zigenzura hagati ukwemerewe kwinjira mu bikoresho bya network n'icyo yemerewe gukora.",
     "Kwinjira hagati bituma ibigo byongera cyangwa bikuraho uburenganzira ahantu hamwe kandi bikabyandika. Koresha verisiyo zitekanye (LDAPS) kugira ngo amagambo y'ibanga atoherezwa nk'inyandiko isanzwe, kandi urinde seriveri z'urutonde neza kuko zibitse konti zose.",
     "LDAP ni itifaki ya kutafuta na kusimamia watumiaji na makundi katika saraka (kama Active Directory). TACACS+ na RADIUS ni itifaki zinazokagua kwa kati nani anaweza kuingia kwenye vifaa vya mtandao na anachoweza kufanya.",
     "Kuingia kwa kati huruhusu mashirika kuongeza au kuondoa ufikiaji mahali pamoja na kuurekodi. Tumia matoleo salama (LDAPS) ili nywila zisitumwe kwa maandishi wazi, na linda seva za saraka kwa makini kwa kuwa zina akaunti zote."),
    ("mobile-app-security-basics", "Mobile app security (root detection, app sandbox)", ["mobile app security", "root detection", "jailbreak detection", "app sandbox", "sim lock", "imei blacklisting", "find my device", "sécurité des applications mobiles", "usalama wa programu za simu"], "cloud", "phone with app shield", {"fr": "Sécurité des applications mobiles", "sw": "Usalama wa programu za simu", "rw": "Umutekano wa porogaramu za telefone"},
     "Phones isolate each app in a sandbox so apps cannot read each other's data. Banking apps may detect rooted or jailbroken devices and refuse to run. SIM lock and IMEI blocking help against theft; 'find my device' tools locate or wipe a lost phone.",
     "Install apps only from official stores, review permissions, keep the OS updated, set a screen lock and SIM PIN, turn on find-my-device, and report a stolen phone to your operator so it can be blocked by its IMEI.",
     "Les téléphones isolent chaque appli dans un bac à sable pour qu'elles ne lisent pas les données des autres. Les applis bancaires peuvent détecter un appareil rooté ou jailbreaké et refuser de fonctionner. Le verrou SIM et le blocage IMEI aident contre le vol ; les outils « localiser mon appareil » retrouvent ou effacent un téléphone perdu.",
     "N'installez des applis que depuis les boutiques officielles, vérifiez les permissions, mettez le système à jour, définissez un verrou d'écran et un PIN de SIM, activez la localisation de l'appareil et signalez un vol à votre opérateur pour bloquer le téléphone via son IMEI.",
     "Telefone zitandukanya buri porogaramu muri sandbox kugira ngo zitasoma amakuru y'izindi. Porogaramu za banki zishobora kubona igikoresho cyakorewe root cyangwa jailbreak zigahakana gukora. SIM lock no guhagarika IMEI bifasha ku bujura; ibikoresho bya find-my-device bibona cyangwa bisiba telefone yatakaye.",
     "Shyiraho porogaramu ziva mu maduka yemewe gusa, genzura uburenganzira, vugurura sisitemu, shyiraho gufunga ecran na PIN ya SIM, fungura find-my-device kandi umenyeshe sosiyete yawe telefone yibwe kugira ngo ifungwe binyuze kuri IMEI.",
     "Simu hutenga kila programu kwenye sandbox ili zisisomee data za nyingine. Programu za benki zinaweza kugundua kifaa kilichofanyiwa root au jailbreak na kukataa kufanya kazi. Kufuli ya SIM na kuzuia IMEI husaidia dhidi ya wizi; zana za find-my-device hupata au kufuta simu iliyopotea.",
     "Sakinisha programu kutoka maduka rasmi tu, kagua ruhusa, sasisha mfumo, weka kufuli ya skrini na PIN ya SIM, washa find-my-device na uripoti simu iliyoibwa kwa mtoa huduma wako ili izuiwe kupitia IMEI."),
    ("detection-methods", "Detection methods (signature, heuristic, behavioural, anomaly)", ["signature-based detection", "signature based detection", "heuristic detection", "behavioural detection", "behavioral detection", "anomaly detection", "detection methods", "détection par signature", "detection par signature", "détection comportementale", "ugunduzi kwa saini"], "operations", "scanner finding patterns", {"fr": "Méthodes de détection", "sw": "Mbinu za ugunduzi", "rw": "Uburyo bwo gutahura"},
     "Ways security tools spot threats: signature-based detection matches known bad patterns; heuristic detection looks for suspicious traits; behavioural detection watches what a program does; anomaly detection flags activity that differs from the normal baseline.",
     "Signatures are fast and accurate for known threats but miss new ones; behavioural and anomaly methods catch unknown threats but raise more false alarms. Good products combine several methods and are updated frequently.",
     "Façons dont les outils de sécurité repèrent les menaces : la détection par signature compare à des motifs malveillants connus ; l'heuristique cherche des traits suspects ; la détection comportementale observe ce que fait un programme ; la détection d'anomalies signale ce qui diffère de la norme.",
     "Les signatures sont rapides et précises pour les menaces connues mais manquent les nouvelles ; les méthodes comportementales et d'anomalies attrapent l'inconnu mais génèrent plus de fausses alertes. Les bons produits combinent plusieurs méthodes et sont mis à jour souvent.",
     "Uburyo ibikoresho by'umutekano bibona ibyago: signature-based igereranya n'imiterere mibi izwi; heuristic ishakisha ibimenyetso bikekwa; behavioural ireba icyo porogaramu ikora; anomaly detection igaragaza ibitandukanye n'ibisanzwe.",
     "Signatures ziroroshye kandi zikwiye ku byago bizwi ariko ntizibona bishya; uburyo bwa behavioural na anomaly bufata ibitazwi ariko butera imburira nyinshi z'ibinyoma. Ibicuruzwa byiza bihuza uburyo bwinshi kandi bikavugururwa kenshi.",
     "Njia ambazo zana za usalama hugundua vitisho: ugunduzi wa saini hulinganisha na mifumo hasidi inayojulikana; heuristic hutafuta sifa za kutia shaka; wa tabia hutazama programu inachofanya; wa mkengeuko huashiria shughuli tofauti na hali ya kawaida.",
     "Saini ni za haraka na sahihi kwa vitisho vinavyojulikana lakini hukosa vipya; mbinu za tabia na mkengeuko hunasa visivyojulikana lakini hutoa tahadhari za uongo zaidi. Bidhaa nzuri huchanganya mbinu kadhaa na husasishwa mara kwa mara."),
    ("ml-in-security", "Machine learning and AI in cybersecurity", ["machine learning in security", "ai in cybersecurity", "ai for security", "ml security", "ai detection", "ia en cybersécurité", "ia en cybersecurite", "ai katika usalama wa mtandao"], "operations", "neural network and shield", {"fr": "Apprentissage automatique et IA en cybersécurité", "sw": "Mashine kujifunza na AI katika usalama wa mtandao", "rw": "Machine learning na AI mu mutekano wa interineti"},
     "Defenders use machine learning to spot phishing, malware, fraud and unusual logins by learning patterns from large amounts of data. Attackers also use AI to write convincing scams, clone voices and automate probing.",
     "AI helps sort huge volumes of alerts and find unknown threats, but it makes mistakes and can be fooled. Treat it as an assistant with human oversight, test it, and remember the basics (updates, MFA, backups) still matter most.",
     "Les défenseurs utilisent l'apprentissage automatique pour repérer hameçonnage, malwares, fraudes et connexions inhabituelles en apprenant des motifs sur de grandes quantités de données. Les attaquants utilisent aussi l'IA pour rédiger des arnaques crédibles, cloner des voix et automatiser des sondages.",
     "L'IA aide à trier d'énormes volumes d'alertes et à trouver des menaces inconnues, mais elle se trompe et peut être dupée. Voyez-la comme un assistant sous supervision humaine, testez-la, et rappelez-vous que les bases (mises à jour, MFA, sauvegardes) comptent toujours le plus.",
     "Abarinzi bakoresha machine learning gutahura phishing, malware, uburiganya no kwinjira bidasanzwe biga imiterere mu makuru menshi. Abagizi ba nabi na bo bakoresha AI mu kwandika uburiganya bwemeza, gukopera amajwi no gukoresha kwikora gusuzuma.",
     "AI ifasha gutondeka imburira nyinshi cyane no kubona ibyago bitazwi, ariko irakosa kandi ishobora kuyobywa. Ifate nk'umufasha ugenzurwa n'abantu, uyigerageze, kandi wibuke ko ibyibanze (ivugurura, MFA, backups) bikiri ingenzi cyane.",
     "Watetezi hutumia mashine kujifunza kugundua hadaa, programu hasidi, ulaghai na kuingia kusiko kwa kawaida kwa kujifunza mifumo kutoka data nyingi. Washambuliaji pia hutumia AI kuandika ulaghai wa kushawishi, kunakili sauti na kuendesha uchunguzi kiotomatiki.",
     "AI husaidia kupanga tahadhari nyingi sana na kupata vitisho visivyojulikana, lakini hukosea na inaweza kudanganywa. Ichukulie kama msaidizi chini ya usimamizi wa binadamu, ijaribu, na ukumbuke misingi (masasisho, MFA, nakala rudufu) bado ni muhimu zaidi."),
]
